    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you can expend 2 Focus Points to make elemental energy burst in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within 120 feet of you, choosing Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder damage. Each creature in the Sphere makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking damage of the chosen type equal to three rolls of your Martial Arts die on a failure, or half as much on a success.</p>",
